# WP-6 Stage 3 (July 12, 2026): /plan/* flipped from 200-proxy to 302 -> app.wizkoo.com.
# The 302 is deliberate and load-bearing: browsers cache 301s forever, which would
# kill the Stage 3 rollback (flip back to proxy). The 301 upgrade belongs to Stage 4
# close-out ONLY. Do not "correct" it. Specific rules before the /plan/* catch-all.
# NOTE: these rules are duplicated in netlify.toml (this file wins); keep both in
# sync. Consolidation flagged for post-surgery.
/plan/onboarding  https://app.wizkoo.com/generate  302
/plan/generate  https://app.wizkoo.com/generate  302
/plan/sign-in  https://app.wizkoo.com/sign-in  302
/plan/sign-in/*  https://app.wizkoo.com/sign-in  302
/plan/sign-up  https://app.wizkoo.com/sign-up  302
/plan/sign-up/*  https://app.wizkoo.com/sign-up  302
/plan/dashboard  https://app.wizkoo.com/  302
/plan/plans/*  https://app.wizkoo.com/plan  302
/plan/today  https://app.wizkoo.com/plan  302
/plan/orbit-reports/*  https://app.wizkoo.com/recap  302
/plan/settings  https://app.wizkoo.com/  302
/plan/pricing  /pricing  302
/plan/privacy  /privacy  302
/plan/terms  /terms  302
/plan  https://app.wizkoo.com/generate  302
/plan/*  https://app.wizkoo.com/generate  302
/planner  /plan  301
/planner.html  /plan  301

# Clean URL redirects — .html → clean path
/what-we-believe.html  /what-we-believe  301
/games.html  /games  301
/methodology.html  /methodology  301

# Library book detail pages — serves /library/book.html for any /library/:slug
